{"key": "coze-anticog", "url": "https://www.wxgaochu.com/coze-anticog.html", "title": "反认知获客框架 ·  AI 军团 | 创作工作台", "html": "<html lang=\"zh-CN\"><plasmo-csui></plasmo-csui><head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>反认知获客框架 ·  AI 军团 | 创作工作台</title>\n  <!-- wxgc-share-meta:start -->\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"创作工作台 AI 军团 · 模块05 内容获客 —— 反认知获客框架智能体，用反常识与认知翻转戳穿行业幻觉，让高客单客户主动咨询。\">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"反认知获客框架 ·  AI 军团 | 创作工作台\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"创作工作台 AI 军团 · 模块05 内容获客 —— 反认知获客框架智能体，用反常识与认知翻转戳穿行业幻觉，让高客单客户主动咨询。\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.wxgaochu.com/assets/img/wxgc-ico.png\">\n  <meta name=\"wx-share:title\" content=\"反认知获客框架 ·  AI 军团 | 创作工作台\">\n  <meta name=\"wx-share:description\" content=\"创作工作台 AI 军团 · 模块05 内容获客 —— 反认知获客框架智能体，用反常识与认知翻转戳穿行业幻觉，让高客单客户主动咨询。\">\n  <meta name=\"wx-share:image\" content=\"https://www.wxgaochu.com/assets/img/wxgc-ico.png\">\n  <!-- wxgc-share-meta:end -->\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"创作工作台 AI 军团 · 模块05 内容获客 —— 反认知获客框架智能体，用反常识与认知翻转戳穿行业幻觉，让高客单客户主动咨询。\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/css/main.css\">\n<style>\n/* ===== 智能体独立嵌入页 · Chat SDK 模式 · 窄行布局 ===== */\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--bg)}\n\n/* 顶部窄行品牌条 */\n.ce-bar{background:rgba(250,246,239,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);\n  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);flex-shrink:0}\n.ce-bar .inner{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;height:56px;\n  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n.ce-bar .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;\n  color:var(--ink);font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-decoration:none}\n.ce-bar .brand img{height:30px;width:auto;border-radius:6px}\n.ce-bar .acts{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}\n.ce-back{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:13px;\n  color:var(--gold-deep);border:1px solid var(--gold);padding:6px 14px;\n  border-radius:20px;transition:.25s;background:transparent;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}\n.ce-back:hover{background:var(--gold);color:#fff}\n.ce-member{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:13px;\n  color:#fff;background:var(--gold-deep);padding:6px 14px;\n  border-radius:20px;transition:.25s;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}\n.ce-member:hover{background:var(--gold)}\n\n/* 智能体信息条 — 无边框、融合页面 */\n.ce-head{background:var(--bg);\n  padding:8px 24px 6px;flex-shrink:0}\n.ce-head .inner{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n.ce-badge{width:38px;height:38px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:11px;\n  display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:19px;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--gold-deep));\n  box-shadow:0 5px 14px rgba(138,90,50,.2)}\n.ce-meta{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;min-width:0}\n.ce-meta .step{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--gold);\n  white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.2;background:none;border:none;border-radius:0;\n  box-shadow:none;padding:0}\n.ce-meta .name{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold-deep);\n  line-height:1.25}\n\n/* 非微信提示 */\n.ce-tip{display:none;background:var(--gold-deep);color:#fff;font-size:12.5px;\n  text-align:center;padding:7px 14px;flex-shrink:0}\n.ce-tip a{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline}\n\n/* 聊天挂载区 */\n#chatMount{position:relative;flex:1;min-height:0;background:#fff;overflow:hidden}\n#chatMount > *{width:100%!important;height:100%!important}\n#chatMount iframe{width:100%;height:100%;border:0;display:block}\n\n/* 加载/失败遮罩 */\n.ce-loading{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n  align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;background:var(--bg);\n  color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:15px;text-align:center;padding:20px}\n.ce-loading span{font-size:12.5px;opacity:.8;max-width:280px;line-height:1.55}\n\n/* 微信引导卡片 */\n.ce-wx-card{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n  align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;background:var(--bg);\n  padding:28px 20px;text-align:center;overflow-y:auto;cursor:pointer;z-index:99999}\n.ce-wx-icon{font-size:48px}\n.ce-wx-title{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold-deep);line-height:1.3}\n.ce-wx-desc{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.65;max-width:320px}\n.ce-wx-steps{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:4px;\n  text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.8;max-width:300px}\n.ce-wx-steps b{color:var(--gold-deep)}\n.ce-wx-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--gold-deep));\n  color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 28px;\n  border-radius:24px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(138,90,50,.3);\n  transition:.25s;margin-top:4px;white-space:nowrap}\n.ce-wx-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(138,90,50,.38)}\n\n/* 聊天嵌入页：隐藏页脚 + 压缩顶部条，给对话区更多垂直空间（~110px） */\nfooter{display:none}\n.ce-bar .inner{height:44px;padding:0 20px}  /* 56→44 */\n.ce-bar .brand img{height:26px}\n.ce-back{padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px}  /* 6/14/13 → 4/12/12 */\n.ce-head{padding:6px 20px 4px}  /* 8+6 → 6+4 */\n.ce-badge{width:32px;height:32px;font-size:17px;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(138,90,50,.18)}  /* 38→32 */\n.ce-meta .name{font-size:17px}  /* 19→17 */\n.ce-meta .step{font-size:11px}  /* 12→11 */\n\n@media(hover:hover){\n  /* 透明触发条：固定在最顶部 44px。聊天加载后生效——鼠标进入触发条区域→顶部条滑出，离开（任何方向）→滑回隐藏 */\n  .ce-trigger{\n    position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:44px;z-index:20;\n    background:transparent;pointer-events:none;\n  }\n  .chat-loaded .ce-trigger{pointer-events:auto}\n  .chat-loaded .ce-bar{\n    position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;\n    transform:translateY(-100%);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;\n    transition:transform .35s ease, opacity .35s ease;\n  }\n  .chat-loaded .ce-trigger:hover ~ .ce-bar,\n  .chat-loaded .ce-bar:hover{\n    transform:translateY(0);opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;\n  }\n}\n\n@media(max-width:880px){\n  .ce-meta .name{font-size:16px}\n  .ce-meta .step{font-size:10.5px}\n  .ce-head .inner{gap:8px}\n  .ce-badge{width:30px;height:30px;font-size:16px}\n}\n</style>\n  \n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/css/visit-counter.css\">\n  <!-- wxgc-wechat-share:start -->\n  \n  <!-- wxgc-wechat-share:end -->\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20data-codex-favicon-badge%3D%22codex-favicon-badge%22%20width%3D%2232%22%20height%3D%2232%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2032%2032%22%3E%3Cimage%20href%3D%22data%3Aimage%2Fbmp%3Bbase64%2CiVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAAgCAYAAABzenr0AAAHIklEQVR4nJRXW29VRRT%2BZu99enrh9AoexLYUQRSDFY3iJV4TjCY%2BEIPiCz74oPESNNHfYYz6BvFJfLDGEGLAEIlBxYKA0MhFoYVS7qXQlran55y998y4Zs3sc6ltgd3u9uzZM2t961vfmlkngLv0ZM8iFL13AbGJHlfQHeC2L0G%2FwlihXz3XpJjuAZqwDWm1RWQ2jriVNDS2vQtafUHrX6VHH3fgWJPZcDJPyzW8lIeaxloLZO5L0rKddH8kWjYMCX1jVyNQ2EovNuJOLoJenAhxatteRCNTEJ4HGcVo6V6K5a%2BtpWd9Kws9QO07AVThTTK23lKYXHpur8l7L8CV3mNI1ddi1Scv8lhckDj59R7cPHMNzfdnAaVnsSmSx%2FXQhT0BPPEWPaZnd4R5gRSvT6JtVQdSTUS7VEg1B2i6dzHCmzk3R89tU5BPId4KaM6aW%2FqbGYT7zKSJ8itBArRjt2mQfBulZ%2BzqW062czzffvAJOznSM1Sv2Y6YdfksVyawJTTPlOQiZ3E%2BxvW%2BAYQTeRJZgHBaoqalqWKpo8SxUB3XLBHSkGf%2BaHYvbnn3f9%2BL4YP9kPkIcS6P4sg4xk5dNrSUnCbWEg%2FJWszAmOSvgoF5gqe7eLOA%2FLVxdH%2F4KgJT6zR414Vx9H%2F7K2TYTXuAqJjtHJREMndVBXN6n6ELHWvU1NdR9fn0WfJYUJeCX5Ny5eZVhmfFoCtAidmFFswbNgdiIxFegsq9oo1H%2BAQm5dM7ulmYNCkw42Q2CGiZrIiA1ir1Py6CahVX0mUjyV0cQ3Esh2g6RKq1GRaJwKVD%2Fbhy%2BBxGB4bRfPgs2h9fhoHdB3HxyDmk%2B6%2FhUt8gOzUgUy0L0LY8i7YVWQTpFA2rMgClpJNBNT0eRXX%2Bl2MY%2Fu046pszLKTp0Slc%2Fr0R7etW459dh%2FDn57uIeJ%2Fy7%2BPuhzvwx1c%2F4mrvIEXulQ4ls04QK%2BmW